⍝ 09 · Word frequency in a text file (reads poem.txt next to this script)
⍝ Run:  dyalog sample-scripts/09-word-count.apls
⍝   or: dyalog sample-scripts/09-word-count.apls path/to/other.txt

args←2⎕NQ'.' 'GetCommandLineArgs'       ⍝ script path, then any arguments
here←⊃1⎕NPARTS⊃args                      ⍝ folder this script is in
file←{1<≢⍵:2⊃⍵ ⋄ here,'poem.txt'}args

text←⎕C⊃⎕NGET file                       ⍝ whole file, lower case
words←((text∊⎕C ⎕A)⊆text)               ⍝ runs of letters = words
⎕←'file: ',file
⎕←'words: ',(⍕≢words),'   unique: ',⍕≢∪words

counts←words{⍺,≢⍵}⌸words
top←5↑counts[⍒counts[;2];]
⎕←'top 5:'
⎕←↑⊃¨{(10↑⍺),⍕⍵}/¨↓top
